        {
          "text": "LU-FEI Ch'ih 陸費墀 (T. 丹叔, H. 頤齋), d. 1790, age 60 (sui), scholar and official, was a native of T'ung-hsiang, Chekiang. An ancestor whose surname was Fei 費 was adopted by a family named Lu 陸, hence the double surname, Lu-fei.",
          "source": "eccp-3645536",
          "kind": "source-wording",
